{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2022-01-25 17:58:00', 'title': 'SYNCHRONY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN., JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL (NYSE: SYF) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON FEBRUARY 17, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 10, 2022.'}